## Component Template (always use this shape)
```tsx
import React from 'react';
{{#if separateCss}}import styles from './ComponentName.module.css';
{{/if}}
interface ComponentNameProps {
  children?: React.ReactNode;
}

export const ComponentName: React.FC<ComponentNameProps> = ({ children }) => {
  return <div{{#if separateCss}} className={styles.container}{{/if}}>{children}</div>;
};
```

## Strict Rules
- Named exports only
- `React.FC<Props>` with typed interface
- No `any`
{{#if separateCss}}- All styles via CSS Modules{{/if}}
